# Intentionally NOT ignored - these ship in the WordPress.org plugin:
# /docs             - user-facing usage guides
# /assets           - provider logo, loaded at runtime
# /plugin.php       - plugin bootstrap; export-ignored for the Composer archive
# /readme.txt       - rendered on wordpress.org; export-ignored for the Composer archive
# /src/autoload.php - registers the PSR-4 autoloader; the Composer archive relies on Composer instead
